        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YRD216ZW2, Push Button Keypad Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYale's Real Living Assure Lock Push Button Keypad Deadbolt, provides convenience for today'\u0019s active lifestyles. A Keypad Entry Door Lock means there are no keys to forget, lose, or worry about whom has a copy. Plus, no more hiding your keys under rocks or in the mailbox. With theReal Living Assure Lock Deadbolt, it is easy to make sure only the people whom you want to have access to your home do. Simplify your life with the latest in front door lock security. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b>  the deadbolt is operated by either a key or an access code from the outside and by a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Century Style Schlage Touch Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Yale KW-1 5 Pin Brass Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Stores up to 25 4 to 8 digit user codes.</li>\r\n<li>Backlight key pad.</li>\r\n<li> Z-Wave Network Module</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Yale YRD216 Keypad Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 5-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Height: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike 1\" x 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 2-year battery life with a 9V battery backup.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YRD216ZW20BP-specifications.pdf?v=1704262379\"><b>Yale YRD216ZW2 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
